WEBVTT

00:13.860 --> 00:21.410
Cola

00:14.320 --> 00:15.860
That woman!

00:15.860 --> 00:17.580
She's making a fool of me.

00:17.580 --> 00:22.250
So she doesn't even need to use magic against someone like me?

00:21.410 --> 00:22.160
Delicacy Cat Powder Cheese

00:22.250 --> 00:23.720
Quit messing with me!

00:23.720 --> 00:27.460
Um, I wish you stopped there.

00:24.690 --> 00:27.460
After wreaking as much havoc as possible,

00:27.460 --> 00:33.300
Live

00:28.090 --> 00:30.180
it's currently running away,

00:30.180 --> 00:33.300
and its current whereabouts are currently unknown but being searched for.

00:33.300 --> 00:35.390
That bitch!

00:35.390 --> 00:39.380
How could I kick her ass, meow?

00:39.380 --> 00:41.450
It seems like you got a real beating.

00:42.100 --> 00:43.420
Hey, aren't you—

00:43.420 --> 00:44.940
Takamiya's imouto!

00:44.940 --> 00:46.380
What's your business?

00:46.380 --> 00:49.770
This is no place for a little girl like you to be at.

00:49.770 --> 00:51.860
Master, the usual please.

00:52.150 --> 00:53.490
Hot Milk

00:58.240 --> 01:00.730
Now come with me.

01:07.880 --> 01:10.590
The one I've profoundly loved

01:10.590 --> 01:14.720
Since the day I came across them

01:14.720 --> 01:20.680
Is none other than you

01:22.520 --> 01:28.190
Who was crying?

01:28.190 --> 01:31.820
The bottom of my faint memories

01:31.820 --> 01:34.530
Won't make me hesitate anymore

01:34.530 --> 01:37.200
Because I've made up my mind

01:37.200 --> 01:43.120
I won't hurt someone precious to me

01:44.290 --> 01:47.040
Even if the whole world

01:49.670 --> 01:53.000
Is against us

01:53.840 --> 02:00.140
Baring their fangs one day

02:01.140 --> 02:05.640
I'll protect what I can, because

02:05.640 --> 02:07.730
I realized

02:07.730 --> 02:12.070
Before I was born that I will fight for you

02:12.070 --> 02:14.440
The one I've profoundly loved

02:14.440 --> 02:18.700
Since the day I came across them

02:18.700 --> 02:22.240
None other than you

02:22.240 --> 02:24.790
If I can't reach you yet

02:24.790 --> 02:31.130
I'll shout your name louder to the sky

02:34.550 --> 02:36.260
Kasumi's Room

02:35.670 --> 02:38.660
Why did you bring me here?

02:38.660 --> 02:40.050
Isn't it your room?

02:40.530 --> 02:43.760
You're not the only one fed up with that woman.

02:43.760 --> 02:45.420
"Fed up"?

02:45.870 --> 02:47.690
Hey, Animal Ears,

02:47.690 --> 02:50.640
don't you think we have the same goal in mind?

02:52.810 --> 02:55.320
We're gonna finish off that Princess together.

02:56.150 --> 03:00.360
My magic is controlling plushies I got from Onii-chan.

03:00.360 --> 03:05.330
Ever since I got to know that, I've been pestering Onii-chan for plushies, and accumulating them.

03:05.330 --> 03:09.640
But I wasn't ready yet to control all of them at the same time.

03:09.640 --> 03:13.380
After I've been training so hard, I can finally put it into practice.

03:13.740 --> 03:17.100
Your magic makes you able to summon that rabbit soldier and control it, doesn't it?

03:17.100 --> 03:17.640
Yeah.

03:17.640 --> 03:20.380
As long as we co-operate, we can wield amazing military power.

03:20.380 --> 03:21.780
And then...

03:23.160 --> 03:24.890
That's...

03:24.890 --> 03:26.390
impossible!

03:26.390 --> 03:28.860
I realized it lately:

03:28.860 --> 03:31.750
there's no point in accumulating them, no matter their count.

03:31.750 --> 03:33.980
I can't win against that woman.

03:33.980 --> 03:35.810
She's the Fire Witch.

03:35.810 --> 03:39.690
With my magic, which is shikigami, I can form a familiar from paper.

03:39.690 --> 03:42.200
Paper burns easily!

03:43.320 --> 03:45.070
You're having it tough too.

03:45.510 --> 03:49.700
Why did you decide to talk to me to begin with, Takamiya Imouto?

03:49.700 --> 03:51.840
I'm an enemy to you all.

03:51.840 --> 03:53.730
If there's someone you have the same intentions with,

03:53.730 --> 03:57.760
wouldn't it be the Fire Witch who's protecting your brother?

03:57.760 --> 04:01.220
I'm protecting Onii-chan and his city.

04:01.220 --> 04:04.220
No matter which witch hinders that,
she's my obvious enemy.

04:04.850 --> 04:08.780
I don't really care about whether I'm affiliated with the Workshop or the Tower.

04:08.780 --> 04:13.300
I needed to enter the Workshop in order to protect Onii-chan.

04:13.300 --> 04:19.570
The reason I chose you is that I thought <i>you're</i> the one who understands my feelings most.

04:19.570 --> 04:23.990
The two of us are comrades whom the Princess caused hardships;

04:23.990 --> 04:25.400
comrades in arms, so to speak.

04:25.400 --> 04:27.890
I'm sure we can form a more powerful union than anyone else;

04:27.890 --> 04:29.200
we can become powerful.

04:29.200 --> 04:32.330
<i>Now's</i> the time to take each other by the hand, and exact revenge!

04:32.330 --> 04:34.250
Takamiya Imouto...

04:34.680 --> 04:36.040
Animal Ears...

04:37.040 --> 04:39.250
Union Formed

04:39.250 --> 04:42.260
Takamiya-kun and
His Imouto's Conspiracy

04:42.870 --> 04:48.600
Still, Imouto, why do you consider the Fire Witch your enemy to <i>that</i> extent?

04:48.600 --> 04:49.600
Huh?

04:49.600 --> 04:55.400
You've been living here all this time and you haven't noticed the disagreement between the Princess and I?!

04:55.400 --> 04:56.020
Huh?

04:56.410 --> 04:57.480
Ahem...

04:57.480 --> 04:59.040
Well, whatever.

04:59.040 --> 05:00.640
I'll explain it for you:

05:00.640 --> 05:04.440
all that woman's devil-like deeds.

05:05.260 --> 05:09.670
The Takamiya household was <i>very</i> peaceful before the Princess came here.

05:09.670 --> 05:12.200
<i>She's</i> the one who came to destroy that peace.

05:13.180 --> 05:16.460
To start with, she stole my sleep.

05:17.000 --> 05:20.860
I sleep with Onii-chan every two days,

05:20.860 --> 05:23.550
but I wasn't able to do that, ever since Princess started disturbing us.

05:23.550 --> 05:25.510
I'm sensitive to cold, after all.

05:23.550 --> 05:25.510
Kasumi's Room

05:25.510 --> 05:28.140
I can't sleep with a peace of mind unless I'm hugging Onii-chan.

05:28.140 --> 05:30.470
Because of that, I spend my days having a hard time getting to sleep,

05:30.470 --> 05:31.930
and now I'm worried about insomnia as well.

05:31.930 --> 05:33.770
The condition of my skin has also worsened.

05:33.770 --> 05:37.120
That woman's scheme has completely succeeded.

05:37.390 --> 05:41.400
But this fearsome attack was only the <i>entrance</i> to Hell:

05:41.890 --> 05:44.860
She stole my fun lunch times too.

05:44.860 --> 05:49.030
At noon, I have lunch with Onii-chan behind the school building where there's no one else.

05:49.030 --> 05:52.710
I have a better appetite when Onii-chan's sitting next to me, you see.

05:52.710 --> 05:55.620
I am able to enjoy the taste of the food with him around.

05:55.620 --> 05:59.210
That is, until he started eating with the Princess.

05:59.210 --> 06:02.670
Because of that, my food became worse,
just like my appetite.

06:02.670 --> 06:05.010
I even lost 0.2kg of weight!

06:05.370 --> 06:06.790
And that isn't everything:

06:06.790 --> 06:12.010
Another part of our daily routine was to shop at the supermarket for supper on the way back from school.

06:08.260 --> 06:12.010
Special Sale Today

06:12.010 --> 06:14.570
Onii-chan was holding the groceries,

06:14.570 --> 06:17.310
and even gave me ideas for making unique dishes.

06:17.310 --> 06:20.020
I can't even do <i>that</i> now, thanks to the Princess.

06:20.020 --> 06:24.020
Even though I was balancing out his diet!

06:24.020 --> 06:27.790
After supper, I spend my time chilling in his room.

06:27.790 --> 06:31.090
I even make sure he's well-prepared for the next day's classes,

06:31.090 --> 06:33.510
as I even went out of my way to teach him.

06:33.510 --> 06:36.830
Now that even <i>that</i> is history, I kinda get the feeling his grades have dropped a little.

06:36.830 --> 06:40.820
She's trying to make them worse so I can't go to the same school Onii-chan goes to.

06:40.820 --> 06:42.080
How mean is that!

06:43.250 --> 06:44.810
Bathing comes after that.

06:44.810 --> 06:46.630
We would have taken one together every two days.

06:47.070 --> 06:49.950
It was part of our bathing routine that Onii-chan washed my whole body.

06:49.950 --> 06:52.090
From my head to my toe.

06:52.090 --> 06:54.230
I like to be clean,

06:54.230 --> 06:56.760
so he would wash me all over my body.

06:56.760 --> 07:00.540
It took about an hour, fully, nothing overlooked.

07:00.540 --> 07:01.920
"Don't you feel embarrassed", he would ask?

07:01.920 --> 07:03.830
Isn't it obvious? We're <i>siblings</i>!

07:03.830 --> 07:06.600
It's an imouto's duty to give a service to her big brother.

07:06.600 --> 07:09.240
Siblings are together from the cradle to the grave.

07:09.560 --> 07:11.820
But even <i>that</i> is history now!

07:12.160 --> 07:15.280
On days off, we were together most of the time.

07:15.280 --> 07:18.030
On days when we had the time to spend the whole day laid back,

07:18.030 --> 07:19.950
we had the time to go shopping.

07:19.950 --> 07:22.440
There was a café we always went to in front of the station.

07:22.440 --> 07:25.320
My favorite food is the tiramisu that's sold there!

07:25.320 --> 07:27.720
He buys one for me once in a while, even now,

07:27.720 --> 07:29.840
but nothing beats eating at the shop, after all.

07:29.840 --> 07:31.520
That's history by now too.

07:31.520 --> 07:34.390
The Princess wants to rob me of <i>every</i> single <i>thing</i>!

07:34.390 --> 07:37.010
That's her fearsome plan!

07:37.350 --> 07:38.180
Which should I—

07:38.180 --> 07:40.540
Wait! Can I ask you something?

07:40.540 --> 07:42.080
What <i>is</i> it?!

07:42.080 --> 07:47.980
I don't know which part of your story makes you detest the Fire Witch,

07:49.100 --> 07:50.650
but, could it be by any chance...

07:50.650 --> 07:53.700
No, maybe it's not by chance, but aren't you a

07:53.700 --> 07:54.870
bro-con?

07:55.400 --> 07:56.240
Huh?!

07:56.240 --> 07:58.600
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What're you <i>talking</i> about?!

07:58.600 --> 08:01.530
What <i>exactly</i> did you read into in order to come to that conclusion?!

08:01.530 --> 08:02.960
Is your brain rotting?!

08:02.960 --> 08:04.010
Is it a dried plum?!

08:04.010 --> 08:05.040
Are you <i>retarded</i>?!

08:05.040 --> 08:08.000
L-L-L-L-L-L-Like <i>hell</i> do I like Onii-chan!!!

08:08.370 --> 08:12.340
O-Onii-chan is m-my future husband is all!!!

08:12.340 --> 08:16.120
Notice my happiness; I'm blessed just by caring for him!

08:16.120 --> 08:17.200
Where's love there?!

08:17.200 --> 08:18.760
Retard!! Retard!!

08:21.490 --> 08:23.620
Anyway, we're done for today.

08:23.620 --> 08:24.900
We'll continue tomorrow.

08:25.410 --> 08:27.630
By the way where are your buddies?

08:27.630 --> 08:28.900
They aren't coming back yet?

08:28.900 --> 08:30.440
They all ran aw—

08:30.440 --> 08:32.680
I mean they're all training.

08:32.680 --> 08:36.030
I guess I stayed here to observe Takamiya-kun.

08:36.030 --> 08:38.720
Then bring someone else here.

08:38.720 --> 08:40.630
Someone who detests the Princess, that is.

08:40.630 --> 08:42.290
We could be numerically stronger then.

08:47.350 --> 08:48.850
Who are these girls?!

08:48.850 --> 08:53.050
Uh, you told me to bring here people who detest the Fire Witch.

08:54.630 --> 08:58.300
And won't these three harm Onii-chan?

08:58.300 --> 09:02.030
The head of the Workshop caught us once,

09:02.030 --> 09:07.480
and we promised not to lay a hand on her, in exchange for canceling the brainwashing from Chronoire.

09:07.480 --> 09:11.640
But we didn't exactly promise that we won't lay a hand on the <i>Fire Witch</i>.

09:11.640 --> 09:13.690
We hold a grudge against that woman anyway.

09:13.690 --> 09:14.720
I see.

09:15.280 --> 09:17.740
In that case, we're starting our conference.

09:15.860 --> 09:15.900
Top Secret

09:17.700 --> 09:17.740
Princess Obliteration Plan

09:17.740 --> 09:21.340
The reason I asked for your co-operation this time

09:21.340 --> 09:24.400
is actually because I devised a certain secret plan.

09:24.400 --> 09:26.210
And to carry that out,

09:26.210 --> 09:28.670
I don't suffice alone.

09:28.670 --> 09:30.800
Come closer.

09:30.800 --> 09:31.960
First...

09:33.960 --> 09:36.340
I got the plan more or less.

09:33.960 --> 09:44.560
Justice

09:36.340 --> 09:39.600
But you really <i>are</i> a dangerous woman.

09:39.600 --> 09:41.620
Someone might die if we're careless!

09:41.620 --> 09:44.560
With this, we just might defeat the Fire Witch!

09:44.560 --> 09:45.630
I know, right?

09:44.560 --> 09:56.320
This is the

09:44.560 --> 09:56.320
Princess

09:44.560 --> 09:56.320
Obliteration

09:44.560 --> 09:56.320
Plan!!

09:45.630 --> 09:48.710
Wait, now that I think of it, aren't we the decoys?

09:48.710 --> 09:50.330
Wh-Wh-What're you <i>talking</i> about?!

09:50.330 --> 09:52.060
Trust me!

09:52.060 --> 09:54.570
The key to our strategy lies in our co-operation!

09:54.590 --> 09:56.320
I got it! Co-operation, right?

09:56.700 --> 09:58.910
The Princess is sleeping in her room.

09:58.910 --> 10:01.190
We're putting the strategy into practice at once!

10:01.190 --> 10:03.660
Good luck and godspeed to everyone!!!

10:03.660 --> 10:04.620
Roger!

10:07.080 --> 10:10.540
Owowowowow!!!

10:11.560 --> 10:13.500
Please stop!

10:14.440 --> 10:16.420
I didn't see anything!

10:20.140 --> 10:21.460
'Morning.

10:21.460 --> 10:22.430
'Morning.

10:22.430 --> 10:23.600
'Morning.

10:24.760 --> 10:26.660
How did you get those scars?

10:26.660 --> 10:28.060
I tripped over in the bathtub.

10:28.740 --> 10:30.760
'Morning to you too, Climber's High-san.

10:30.760 --> 10:31.540
My name's <i>Kuraishi</i>!

10:31.540 --> 10:32.690
I <i>know</i> you're doing it on purpose!

10:38.900 --> 10:42.870
I wonder if Onii-chan doesn't even need me protecting him anymore.

10:43.440 --> 10:46.780
Is my duty over?

10:47.830 --> 10:49.370
Kasumi-shi.

10:49.370 --> 10:50.400
What gives.

10:50.400 --> 10:51.080
It's you, Tanuma-shi.

10:51.080 --> 10:53.780
What do you mean "what gives"?

10:53.780 --> 10:54.510
Hey, listen.

10:54.510 --> 10:58.920
Doesn't season two of My Little Sister Can't Be This Potato go on sale <i>today</i>?

10:58.920 --> 10:59.840
Oh!

10:59.840 --> 11:01.010
I completely forgot about that!

11:01.010 --> 11:02.550
You made a pre-order, didn't you?

11:02.550 --> 11:03.180
Yup.

11:03.180 --> 11:07.060
The relationship between that big brother and little sister is so ideal!

11:07.060 --> 11:08.910
Let's buy it after school!

11:08.910 --> 11:12.960
Ah, but Rinon-senpai called me.

11:12.960 --> 11:13.610
Huh?!

11:13.610 --> 11:15.940
That bear-killer?!

11:16.400 --> 11:19.280
I'm sorry, but could you buy it for me, Tanuma-shi?

11:19.280 --> 11:20.050
Huh?

11:20.050 --> 11:21.400
Got it!

11:23.720 --> 11:25.300
Healing.

11:25.300 --> 11:27.080
Watching My Little Sister Can't Be This Potato

11:27.620 --> 11:28.880
is healing.

11:35.670 --> 11:39.070
This is the <i>perfect</i> place for basking in the sun.

11:39.970 --> 11:42.860
Do you agree, Imouto's familiar.

11:44.500 --> 11:48.060
By the way I wonder when Kanna and the others are coming back.

11:50.140 --> 11:53.650
Kasumi-chan! Let's hang around!

11:53.650 --> 11:56.670
Oh, you came over, Tanuma-shi!

11:56.670 --> 11:59.110
But of course, Kasumi-shi!

11:59.110 --> 12:00.070
Ta-dah!

11:59.110 --> 12:00.070
Don't enter without permission!

11:59.110 --> 12:00.070
Kasumi's Room

11:59.110 --> 12:00.070
Entry for Authorized Personnel Only

12:00.070 --> 12:05.410
I received the pre-order of My Little Sister Can't Be This Potato 2nd season vol.8.

12:00.070 --> 12:05.410
My Little Sister Can't Be This Potato

12:05.410 --> 12:06.660
Oh!

12:06.660 --> 12:08.480
Well done, Tanuma-shi!

12:08.480 --> 12:10.160
Here's the price.

12:10.160 --> 12:14.790
Are you sure about paying the whole sum,
even though we usually cover half each, Kasumi-chan?

12:14.790 --> 12:16.920
My senpai paid me in advanced,

12:16.920 --> 12:18.680
since I help out at their job.

12:18.680 --> 12:20.010
Well, let's get down to it.

12:37.050 --> 12:38.190
It's over.

12:41.130 --> 12:44.640
Its content become hard to take in all of a sudden.

12:44.640 --> 12:46.160
Yeah.

12:46.160 --> 12:49.460
Especially the part where the imouto confessed to her blood-related big brother.

12:49.460 --> 12:51.190
That was the real deal.

12:51.190 --> 12:51.750
Huh?

12:51.750 --> 12:56.140
They were good siblings up to this point,
but they can't go back now.

12:51.750 --> 12:54.330
Salty Potato Chips

12:51.750 --> 12:54.330
This Potato

12:56.140 --> 12:58.680
There's no love between siblings, is there?

12:58.680 --> 13:00.990
All it would bring is sadness to the people around them;

13:00.990 --> 13:02.120
it's impossible.

13:02.120 --> 13:02.880
Come again?

13:02.880 --> 13:05.470
I was thinking that's a little creepy.

13:05.490 --> 13:06.570
Come again?!

13:07.430 --> 13:10.920
Kasumi-shi, there's something I want you to answer honestly.

13:10.920 --> 13:11.930
What's it suddenly?

13:14.140 --> 13:17.100
Kasumi-chan, you like your onii-chan, right?

13:17.100 --> 13:17.870
Huh?!

13:17.870 --> 13:20.400
I-I-I-I-It's not like I like him!!

13:20.400 --> 13:22.250
Why are you so obstinate about that?

13:22.250 --> 13:22.820
I'm not!

13:23.120 --> 13:26.080
Why did you say earlier that you'll marry to him in the future, then?

13:26.080 --> 13:27.240
Well, I will for sure.

13:27.240 --> 13:28.020
You will?!

13:28.020 --> 13:28.630
Yup.

13:28.630 --> 13:31.330
Marriage comes after love, doesn't it?

13:31.330 --> 13:33.170
Isn't it a matter of personal preference?

13:33.170 --> 13:36.160
There are <i>lots</i> of people who marry even though they aren't in love.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.480
What about your children, then?

13:37.480 --> 13:39.110
You said you'll give birth to three, didn't you?

13:39.110 --> 13:41.260
You <i>do</i> know where children come from, right?

13:41.260 --> 13:42.560
Of <i>course</i> I do!

13:42.560 --> 13:43.960
I'm a high-schooler, you know!

13:43.960 --> 13:47.620
Um, so with Onii-chan, you'll... um... have se—

13:47.620 --> 13:48.910
Um, so with Onii-chan, you'll... um... have se—

13:48.910 --> 13:50.280
Um, so with Onii-chan, you'll... um... have se—

13:50.280 --> 13:52.400
<i>Birds</i> bring children, right?

13:52.400 --> 13:54.300
Like tiny Pteranodons.

13:54.300 --> 13:54.980
What?!

13:54.980 --> 13:59.480
Mama told me such a bird will bring a child at the peak of a couple's happiness.

13:59.480 --> 14:01.480
Are you serious?

14:01.480 --> 14:03.000
Well, I am.

14:03.000 --> 14:04.760
What's wrong, Tanuma-shi?

14:04.760 --> 14:05.780
You're a little scary.

14:07.110 --> 14:09.480
Not long ago, in health and physical education...

14:09.480 --> 14:10.590
Um...

14:10.590 --> 14:11.950
Weren't we told that?

14:11.950 --> 14:13.960
Ah, the thing about children?

14:13.960 --> 14:16.160
There's that other means of making them too.

14:16.160 --> 14:18.070
That's <i>real</i> filthy.

14:18.070 --> 14:19.180
I see.

14:20.000 --> 14:21.280
Never mind.

14:21.280 --> 14:23.120
Forget I said anything.

14:24.340 --> 14:26.590
Kasumi, it's time to work.

14:27.050 --> 14:28.480
Rinon-senpai.

14:27.050 --> 14:29.430
The bear-killer!

14:30.470 --> 14:34.560
The giant penguin that appeared once again, is devastating the city right now.

14:39.190 --> 14:43.240
I'll work you very hard for the money I paid you in advance.

14:43.240 --> 14:46.030
Kasumi-shi!

14:48.090 --> 14:50.080
Hey, I have nothing to do with it!

14:50.080 --> 14:50.820
Let me go!

14:56.590 --> 14:57.680
Senpai!

14:57.680 --> 14:59.920
Um, what's going on here?

14:59.920 --> 15:01.880
I have no clue about what's going on!

15:01.880 --> 15:05.420
I thought you wanted me work at the café, but why are we preparing to fight?!

15:05.420 --> 15:09.380
That there is the giant penguin that's disturbing the city, right?

15:09.380 --> 15:11.320
Yes, exactly.

15:11.320 --> 15:14.140
Your job is to blow that off.

15:14.140 --> 15:16.890
It's a Workshop Witch's mission to protect the city.

15:16.890 --> 15:20.090
Show me your power, as my successor!

15:21.320 --> 15:26.610
Onii-chan loves penguins,
so I'm not very inclined to do it,

15:27.250 --> 15:29.530
but I must show my skills to Senpai.

15:29.530 --> 15:31.330
Hey, you all!

15:31.330 --> 15:33.410
Was having me as a replacement your aim from the get-go?

15:33.410 --> 15:35.600
Considering how strong a witch I am,

15:35.600 --> 15:37.290
it's a natural step to seek my cooperation.

15:37.290 --> 15:40.390
But no matter what, you're Tower Witches!

15:40.390 --> 15:42.440
Why are you here?

15:42.440 --> 15:44.460
It's dangerous so please keep a distance.

15:45.290 --> 15:47.210
Y-You bastards...

15:47.210 --> 15:49.970
Did you really make a fool of me <i>that</i> much?!

15:49.970 --> 15:53.680
Well, I'll crush a papier-mâché like that with my mere fingers.

15:54.240 --> 15:56.290
Watch me, Master!

16:04.600 --> 16:07.640
It reflected my kick!

16:07.640 --> 16:09.070
What are you doing, Kasumi?!

16:09.380 --> 16:12.220
There's only about 15 minutes till it vanishes!

16:12.220 --> 16:16.120
Don't fight sluggishly with that small size; enlargen it more!

16:16.120 --> 16:17.720
Show it to it at once!

16:17.720 --> 16:19.160
Rinon-senpai,

16:19.160 --> 16:22.280
when I raged around doing something similar back then,

16:22.280 --> 16:24.620
the Board Chairwoman scolded me severely.

16:24.620 --> 16:26.920
Ever since then, there's a limit to its size.

16:26.920 --> 16:27.850
I don't mind it.

16:27.850 --> 16:29.110
I'm giving you permission.

16:29.110 --> 16:30.260
Now enlargen it!

16:31.330 --> 16:33.560
If you say that, Rinon-senpai...

16:33.560 --> 16:34.720
Go, Macaron!

16:40.600 --> 16:42.440
The game is over.

16:42.440 --> 16:44.810
It's a pity, but I'll have it defeated.

16:48.880 --> 16:50.610
It became bigger too!

16:50.610 --> 16:53.540
Hey, weird animals there!

16:53.540 --> 16:56.000
You dig your own cave when you forget me.

16:56.000 --> 16:59.380
You thought I'm lazing around each day doing nothing?

16:59.380 --> 17:01.200
That's an unthinkably grave mistake.

17:01.200 --> 17:03.710
With my newly developed superdreadnought rabbit soldier,

17:03.710 --> 17:07.500
I'll make everyone who makes a fool of me orbit around the Earth!

17:09.680 --> 17:12.210
The revenge that bear was looking for...

17:16.760 --> 17:19.430
Why did you two just suddenly emerge?!

17:26.790 --> 17:28.440
They're trying to team up?

17:31.520 --> 17:33.440
In that case, we'll do the same!

18:01.730 --> 18:03.140
Crap!

18:03.140 --> 18:04.890
Anyway, I'll make the first move!

18:04.890 --> 18:05.860
I'm counting on you.

19:14.010 --> 19:16.250
Here's the finishing blow!

19:16.250 --> 19:17.280
'Kay.

19:39.490 --> 19:42.720
Hey, Kasumi!

19:42.720 --> 19:44.280
Can you hear me?

19:44.280 --> 19:47.880
No matter what happens in the battle, you <i>mustn't</i> back down!

19:47.880 --> 19:49.500
You can only keep moving forward!

19:49.500 --> 19:52.750
I expect you to be able to ascend more!

19:53.080 --> 19:54.480
Rinon-senpai.

19:55.050 --> 19:56.390
That's right:

19:56.390 --> 19:59.090
I'm a Workshop Witch with a great mission.

19:59.900 --> 20:03.680
I absolutely mustn't lose, for the sake of protecting Onii-chan's city too.

20:04.300 --> 20:07.460
Up until this point, I thought this was my limit.

20:07.460 --> 20:11.280
But this is just a limit I arbitrarily set to myself.

20:11.280 --> 20:14.310
I'm supposed to be able to aim for greater heights.

20:14.310 --> 20:16.060
Here I come!

20:16.640 --> 20:18.880
Macaron!

20:37.040 --> 20:38.380
Remember this:

20:38.380 --> 20:44.200
I, Takamiya Kasumi, am a Workshop Witch who'll protect the peace of this city!

20:44.200 --> 20:46.430
I'm a hero of justice!

20:49.310 --> 20:50.580
Wait, why?!

20:50.580 --> 20:51.640
I...!

21:00.610 --> 21:02.760
It was a shocker today.

21:02.760 --> 21:06.570
According to Mama-san, she's an acquantiance of the bear-killer,

21:06.570 --> 21:10.410
but I wonder if Kasumi-chan is the friend of such a bad person.

21:10.410 --> 21:10.950
Huh?

21:16.120 --> 21:18.000
Kasumi, take a look.

21:18.000 --> 21:20.080
This is an object representative of a divine spirit.

21:20.080 --> 21:22.260
Is this where that giant penguin originated from?

21:24.530 --> 21:25.130
What's this?

21:25.130 --> 21:26.120
A sign!

21:26.120 --> 21:27.840
Isn't it one of Onii-chan's sculptures?!

21:28.320 --> 21:29.920
Did you realize something?

21:29.920 --> 21:32.120
Investigating that, the culprit may be...

21:32.120 --> 21:34.100
Crap, I gotta do something!

21:34.100 --> 21:37.080
Ahh, Tachi Hiroshi's there!

21:37.080 --> 21:37.980
Huh? Where?

21:37.980 --> 21:39.060
Where <i>is</i> he?

21:39.480 --> 21:42.880
Hey, Kasumi, it's just Touch Hero.

21:42.880 --> 21:46.510
Um, I mistook it for that bronze statue.

21:46.920 --> 21:48.490
It doesn't resemble him at all.

21:49.480 --> 21:50.910
Huh? Where's the evidence?

21:50.910 --> 21:53.700
Ahh, it suddenly vanished!

21:53.700 --> 21:56.120
It must be a Tower Witch's doing!

21:56.120 --> 21:57.520
I see.

21:57.520 --> 22:00.220
Well then, let's report it to the Board Chairwoman.

22:00.220 --> 22:02.040
This damn inferior witch!

22:02.040 --> 22:03.830
Uh, I don't think it's our—

22:06.100 --> 22:10.220
I protected Onii-chan and his city.

22:10.220 --> 22:15.320
It seems like Onii-chan needs me <i>more</i> than he needs the Princess, after all.

22:15.320 --> 22:17.250
All right, let's go, Macaron,

22:18.200 --> 22:20.610
to the place Onii-chan's waiting at.

22:26.440 --> 22:27.860
Tweet-tweet, make a tweet!

22:27.860 --> 22:29.610
Witch activity

22:29.610 --> 22:32.450
That's the spirit! That's the time! Put in all your heart!

22:32.450 --> 22:33.700
Which? Which?

22:33.700 --> 22:35.410
Tower or workshop?

22:35.540 --> 22:38.370
All the witches may get entangled

22:38.370 --> 22:39.710
Turn round and round, then wake up

22:39.710 --> 22:41.460
Fancy crisis

22:41.460 --> 22:43.960
Everywhere's a witch 24/7

22:43.960 --> 22:44.550
Witch!

22:52.220 --> 22:55.100
Everyone and their dog move their ears twitchingly

22:55.100 --> 22:57.850
With a cheerful heart

22:58.140 --> 23:01.020
Of course there's no common sense here

23:01.020 --> 23:03.980
Witches do whatever they like

23:03.980 --> 23:06.940
Every rabbit's eyes are sparkling

23:06.940 --> 23:09.910
And their hearts leaping

23:09.990 --> 23:12.820
If it's love then it's a lost cause

23:12.820 --> 23:15.830
The spell is “I love you”

23:15.910 --> 23:18.660
Please grant my wish

23:18.910 --> 23:21.540
Grant it like a prayer

23:21.880 --> 23:24.670
I'm using my beast-like instincts

23:24.670 --> 23:26.090
My daydream delusions are in the

23:26.090 --> 23:27.710
Territory

23:29.090 --> 23:30.470
Tweet-tweet, move!

23:30.470 --> 23:32.300
Witch activity

23:32.300 --> 23:35.060
Express your feelings with your ears

23:35.060 --> 23:38.100
Tick-tock, it doesn't get canceled

23:38.100 --> 23:40.940
Clock hand, spin the way we're spinning

23:40.940 --> 23:41.690
Ticktick, ticktick

23:41.690 --> 23:42.310
Three, two, one

23:42.310 --> 23:44.110
Fancy crisis

23:44.110 --> 23:46.190
Each and everyone in your world is a

23:46.190 --> 23:47.110
Witch! Witch!
